the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    Antrag holds for *a case*.
    the answer to Antrag for *a case* is *a truth value*; scenario element.
    Antrag would hold for *a case*; unknown.

the knowledge base r4_11_accept_hash_algorithms includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/accept-hash-algorithms.ruml".

estg sha3 is published at "https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/estg/__32a.html".

estg sha256 is published at "https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/estg/__32a.html".

estg blake3 is published at "https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/estg/__32a.html".

Antrag holds for a case if
    the answer to Antrag for the case is true.

% Until a person answers, RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Antrag holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the answer to Antrag for the case is a truth value
    and Antrag would hold for the case.

scenario generated_1 is, as stated in "accept-hash-algorithms.ruml" at generated_1:
    % no data
    node_1 expects answers ["Antrag holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_1 expects answers ["it is not the case that Antrag holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.

scenario generated_2 is, as stated in "accept-hash-algorithms.ruml" at generated_2:
    % every leaf answered yes
    the answer to Antrag for case 1 is true.
    node_1 expects answers ["Antrag holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_1 expects answers [].

scenario generated_3 is, as stated in "accept-hash-algorithms.ruml" at generated_3:
    % the leaf 1 answered no, the others yes
    the answer to Antrag for case 1 is false.
    node_1 expects answers [].
    not_node_1 expects answers ["it is not the case that Antrag holds for case 1"].

scenario generated_4 is, as stated in "accept-hash-algorithms.ruml" at generated_4:
    % every leaf answered no
    the answer to Antrag for case 1 is false.
    node_1 expects answers [].
    not_node_1 expects answers ["it is not the case that Antrag holds for case 1"].

query node_1 is:
    Antrag holds for case 1.

query not_node_1 is:
    it is not the case that Antrag holds for case 1.

